urchase at price of ₹1.75 Cr. The flat is placed on 7 floor encompassing carpet area 700 sqft. The apartment provides power back up, reserved parking, security, service/goods lift, air conditioned, ro water system.   Nearby Landmark: Magathane Metro station, Magathane Bus Depot.   [View Property](/propertyDetails/2-BHK-700-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Borivali-East-in-Mumbai&id=4d423835383434303739)\n\n![1BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Ariana Residency at Borivali East](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"1BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Ariana Residency at Borivali East\")\n\n## 1 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali East Mumbai\n\nWest facing flat with excellent ventilation. New Flat in New Development.   \n  \nThis 1 BHK apartment in Borivali East, Mumbai is available for sale.It has an excellent location within Ariana Residency. This ready to move flat in Borivali East is available for a price of ₹91 Lac. Positioned on 3 floor, the property spans carpet area 400 sqft. The apartment is provided with power back up, reserved parking, security, intercom facility. P51800008691 is the RERA number of the project. Properties in Ariana Residency are priced between ₹83.3 Lac - ₹1.71 Cr, available in 1,2,3 bhk flats options.   Nearby Landmark: Close to operational Metro Station and Western Express Highway.   [View Property](/propertyDetails/1-BHK-400-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Borivali-East-in-Mumbai&id=4d423634353238373939)\n\n![2BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Dattapada](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"2BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Dattapada\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Dattapada Mumbai\n\nMultistorey apartment is available for sale. It Carpet/Built-up area of 650 sq-ft, it is a good location property. Please contact for more details.   \n  \nA well-positioned 2 BHK flat in Dattapada, Mumbai. You can buy this ready to move apartment in Dattapada, at the price of ₹1.60 Cr.The flat is placed on 2 floor encompassing carpet area 650 sqft. This residence offers reserved parking, security.    [View Property](/propertyDetails/2-BHK-650-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Dattapada-in-Mumbai&id=4d423733393133333533)\n\n![1BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Hitech Menaba at Borivali East](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"1BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Hitech Menaba at Borivali East\")\n\n## 1 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali East Mumbai\n\nMultistorey apartment is available for sale. It is a good location property. Please contact for more details.   \n  \nThis well maintained 1 BHK residence is currently offered for sale in Borivali East, Mumbai.This under construction flat in Borivali East can be availed at a price of ₹78 Lac. The unit is located on 16 floor featuring covered area 296 sqft.    [View Property](/propertyDetails/1-BHK-296-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Borivali-East-in-Mumbai&id=4d423835313838353133)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.commonfloor.com/kanakia-country-park-phase-iii-mumbai/povp-5o6j2p","title":"Kanakia Country Park Phase III in Borivali East, Mumbai | Find Price, Gallery, Plans, Amenities on CommonFloor.com","raw_content":"![Commonfloor - India's Premium Real Estate Portal](data:image/png;base64, )\n![Commonfloor - India's Premium Real Estate Portal](https://teja8.kuikr.com/cfassets/images/cf_logo.webp )\n\nKanakia Country Park Phase III\n\n# Kanakia Country Park Phase III By: [Kanakia Space Pvt. Ltd](/kanakia-space-pvt-ltd/builder/mkf4gq \"Kanakia Space Pvt. Ltd\") in [Borivali East](/borivali-east-mumbai/rvp-52c251df4fb58 \"Property in Borivali East\")\n\nBy:\n[Kanakia Space Pvt. Ltd](/kanakia-space-pvt-ltd/builder/mkf4gq \"Kanakia Space Pvt. Ltd\") \nin\n[Borivali East](/borivali-east-mumbai/rvp-52c251df4fb58 \"Property in Borivali East\")\n\n## 94.50 L onwards\n\n![kanakia-country-park-phase-iii-mumbai](https://teja12.kuikr.com/is/a/c/880x425/gallery_images/original/cf5a68467854c51.gif \"kanakia-country-park-phase-iii-mumbai\")\n![](data:image/png;base64, )\n\nChange your area measurement\n\n## Unit Configuration\n\n## Location\n\n![Explore Now]()\n\n## Amenities - Kanakia Country Park Phase III\n\n## \n\n## Properties in Kanakia Country Park Phase III\n\n## \n\n## About Kanakia Country Park Phase III\n\n**Kanakia Country Park Phase III**  – Luxury Apartments with Unmatched Lifestyle Amenities.\n\n**Key Highlights of Kanakia Country Park Phase III:** .\n\n• Spacious Apartments : Choose from elegantly designed 1 BHK, 2 BHK and 3 BHK BHK Apartments, with a well-planned 9 structure.\n\n• Premium Lifestyle Amenities: Access lifestyle amenities, with modern facilities.\n\n• Vaastu Compliant: These homes are Vaastu-compliant with efficient designs that maximize space and functionality.\n\n• Prime Location: Kanakia Country Park Phase III is strategically located close to IT hubs, reputed schools, colleges, hospitals, malls, and the metro station, offering the perfect mix of connectivity and convenience.\n\n**Discover Luxury and Convenience** .\n\nStep into the world of Kanakia Country Park Phase III, where luxury is redefined. The contemporary design, with façade lighting and lush landscapes, creates a tranquil ambiance that exudes sophistication. Each home is designed with attention to detail, offering spacious layouts and modern interiors that reflect elegance and practicality.\n\nWhether it's the world-class amenities or the beautifully designed homes, Kanakia Country Park Phase III stands as a testament to luxurious living. Come and explore a life of comfort, luxury, and convenience.\n\n**Kanakia Country Park Phase III**  – Address Western Express Highway, Borivali East, Mumbai, Maharashtra, INDIA.  \n.\n\n## About The Builder :\n\nThe Kanakia family has gradually become an inseparable and an essential part of living of many modern citizens. From providing premium housing to education, quality entertainment to promotion of art and culture, Kanakia's have made a holistic contribution to elevate modern lifestyles in suburban Mumbai.  \n  \n  \n  \n. Housing projects undertaken by Kanakia, always strike a desired balance between convenient and accessible locations, spacious and well-planned layouts, modern designs and contemporary life standards and recreation for the entire family. Our renowned commercial projects like Floral Deck Plaza, Eagle's Flight and 349 Business Point is looked upon as ultimate business destinations of the new generation.  \n  \n  \n  \nEach Kanakia project is a landmark in its own right, sought after for its striking architecture, well planned interiors and lasting construction standards. Each project is the outcome of deep-rooted professional insight and inputs of some of India's leading architects, RCC experts and consultants associated with the projects.  \n  \n  \n  \nWe have successfully delivered more than 8 million sq. ft. of residential and commercial projects that are land marks owing to their design, micro locations and occupant profiles. Company has over 5 million sq. ft. of space under various stages of development country wide.\n\n# 215, Atrium,10th Floor, Next to Courtyard by Marriott Hotel, Opposite Divine Child High School, Andheri Kurla Road, Andheri (East), Mumbai - 400 093, Maharashtra, INDIA.\n\nProjects in Mumbai\n\n## Other project by Kanakia Space Pvt. Ltd :\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Sevens\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Paris\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Zen World\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Levels\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Rainforest\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Hollywood\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Sanskruti\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Discovery\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Sky High\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Miami\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Spaces Ananta\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Ananta\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Samarpan Royale\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Silver Oak\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Challengers\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Country Park\n\n![]()\n\n### kanakia K14\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Suman Apartments\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Platino\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Art House\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Aroha\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Park Apartment\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Samarpan\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Sky Walk\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Celebration\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Iraisa Apartments\n\n![]()\n\n### Kanakia Blue Bell\n\n## \n\n## Similar Searches\n\n##### Properties For Sale In Borivali East\n\n##### Properties For Sale In Borivali East By Budget\n\n##### Properties For Sale In Mumbai\n\n##### Properties For Rent In Mumbai\n\n##### Properties For Sale In Mumbai By Budget\n\n##### Projects In Borivali East\n\n##### Projects In Mumbai\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions on Kanakia Country Park Phase III\n\n#### [1.Where is Kanakia Country Park Phase III located?](#collapse0)\n\nThe project is located in Western Express Highway, Borivali East, Mumbai, Maharashtra, INDIA.\n\n#### [2.What is available Apartment size in Kanakia Country Park Phase III?](#collapse1)\n\nApartment sizes in the project range from 540 sqft to 1090 sqft.\n\n#### [4. How much is the area of 2 BHK in Kanakia Country Park Phase III?](#collapse2)\n\nThe area of 2 BHK apartments ranges from 802 sqft to 900 sqft.\n\n#### [5. What is the total size of Kanakia Country Park Phase III?](#collapse3)\n\nThe project is spread over an area of 1.00 Acres.\n\n#### [6. What is the price of 3 BHK in Kanakia Country Park Phase III?](#collapse4)\n\nPrice of 3 BHK unit in the project is Rs. 1.91 Crs\n\n## Real Estate Blog\n\n## \n\n![Commonfloor - India's Premium Real Estate Portal]()\n\n## CommonFloor is Better on App!\n\nFind your Dream Home from **1.9L+ Projects**. Get **Unlimited Free Alerts** matching your needs.\n\n![Commonfloor App Promo]()\n![Powered by Quikr]()\n\nThe information provided herein have been collected from publicly\navailable sources, and is yet to be verified as per RERA guidelines.\\* [Read more..](javascript:void(0);)\n\nThe information sources used here include onsite interviews, marketing\nmaterial and other information sourc