fchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 430 sqft - 835 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 144 Units & 12 Towers\n* Total Project Area: 10 Acres\n* Possession: January, 2009\n* Rera:\n\n## About\n\n5.0\n\n##### Excellent\n\n**Kanakia Country Park** is a real estate venture by Kanakia Spaces, situated in Borivali East locality of Mumbai city. Located in the vicinity of this project **Kanakia Country Park** are world famous schools. It has all the basic amenities and offers great strategic location. Borivali being one of the main hubs of the city and also it offers plenty of transportation facilities via trains and bus to all the area of the city as well as outstation makes it a prime location to invest and live in.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg) Sports Facility\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Power Back-up](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886956_power_back_up.svg) Power Back-up\n* ![Waste Disposal](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886685_waste_disposal.svg) Waste Disposal\n* ![Maintenance Staff](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804773_maintenance-staff.svg) Maintenance Staff\n* ![Cafeteria](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886485_cafeteria.svg) Cafeteria\n* ![Club house](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804551_club-house.svg) Club house\n\n## Floor Plans of Kanakia Country Park\n\n![Kanakia Country Park Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/floorplan/40543/40543_512_a.jpeg \"Kanakia Country Park Floor Plan 430 sqft\")\n\n1 BHK (430 Sq. Ft.)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\nLoan Amount (80% of Total Cost) : 1 Cr\n\n## Rental Options Available!\n\nExplore rental flats in Godrej E-City\n\n [Check Rental Listings →](https://rental.addressofchoice.com/property-for-rent-in-kanakia-country-park-borivali-east-mumbai-prop40543)\n\n## Bank Offers for Kanakia Country Park\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958784_sbi.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958779_icici.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958773_hdfc.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958767_axis.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958761_canara.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958377_indiabulls.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958423_pnb.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958411_tata.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528957944_reliance_capital.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528956975_dhfl.png \" \")\n\n![imageBackh](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/imageBackh.png)\n\n## Hi! I'm here to answer all your queries.\n\n**Vaishali Vasant Tiwari**  \n Relationship Manager\n\n[Chat with us](https://wa.me/8800117588?text=I'm%20interested%20in%20Kanakia Country Park)\n\n## Kanakia Country Park Specifications\n\n![Structure](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/floor-plans2.svg)\n\nStructure\n\nRCC structure as per code of practice\n\n![Security](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/security_personnel-grey.svg)\n\nSecurity\n\nSecurity guard at Project main entrance. CCTV Surveillance.\n\n![Kitchen](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/kitchen.svg)\n\nKitchen\n\nGranite top working platform\n\n![Flooring](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/floor.svg)\n\nFlooring\n\nVitrified tiles in drawing/dining/bedrooms and kitchen\n\n![Plumbing & Sanitary](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/plumber.svg)\n\nPlumbing & Sanitary\n\nWhite sanitary wares with European WC, CP fittings\n\n![Electrical & Power Backup](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/power_back_up-grey.svg)\n\nElectrical & Power Backup\n\nCopper wiring in concealed PVC conduits Sufficient light and power points Provision for TV and telephone points in living room and all bedrooms\n\n## Locality Overview of Borivali East, Mumbai\n\nLocation\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\nLivibility score\n\nBorivali east is one of the leading areas from east and west parts of the Borivali area. The harbor railway separates them. One can see massive development in this area as far as real estate projects are concerned. For this area the biggest positive is its connectivity to the areas of the city as well as other parts of the state as it is on the Western Highway. The area has some of th... [Read More](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-east/guide)\n\n## Explore Neighbourhoods of kanakia country park, Borivali East\n\n##\n\n##\n\n##\n\n## Properties Price Trend in the Borivali East\n\n## Similar Properties to Kanakia Country Park in Borivali East\n\nReady to Move\n\n![Triveni Neel Aakash](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/39168/Triveni_Neel_Aakash_elevation_1.jpg)\n\n##### [Triveni Neel Aakash](https://www.addressofchoice.com/triveni-neel-aakash-borivali-east-mumbai-p39168)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc