04)\n\n![...](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/floorplan/40543/1562148482_Kanakia_Country_Park_2_BHK.jpeg)\n\n##### 2 BHK Flat (835 sq. ft.)\n\nReady to Move\n\n2 BHK+2T Apartments with Size 835/sqft-saleable for sale at ₹ 2.44 Cr in Kanakia country park, Borivali East Mumbai.\n\n#### ₹ 2.44 Cr\n\n[View Detail](https://www.addressofchoice.com/kanakia-country-park-borivali-east-mumbai/2-bhk-835sqft-apartment-p40998)\n\n## Tools & Advice\n\n![Rates & Trends](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/Rates-trends.svg)\n\n##### Rates & Trends\n\nKnow all about Property Rates & Trends in your city.\n\n[View More ![right_arrow](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/right_arrow.svg)](#)\n\n![EMI Calculator](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/emi_calculator.svg)\n\n##### EMI Calculator\n\nQuarterly report with insights of Indian real estate market.\n\n[View More ![right_arrow](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/right_arrow.svg)](#price_listWarpper)\n\n![Investment Hotspot](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/investment_hotspot.svg)\n\n##### Investment Hotspot\n\nQuarterly report with insights of Indian real estate market.\n\n[View More ![right_arrow](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/right_arrow.svg)](#)\n\n![Research Insights](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/research_insights.svg)\n\n##### Research Insights\n\nQuarterly report with insights of Indian real estate market.\n\n[View More ![right_arrow](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/right_arrow.svg)](#)\n\n## About Kanakia Spaces Projects and Developers\n\n![Kanakia Spaces](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/developer/1784266860_kanakia_logo.jpg \"Kanakia Spaces\")\n\n* 41 Years of Experience\n* 42 Total Projects\n* 0 Ongoing Projects\n\nKanakia Spaces is a leading property developer group which was established in 1986. Based at Mumbai the group has vast experience in the real estate development where it has completed 43 projects till date and 9 more projects are still under development which shows the development of the group also.    ....   \n [Read More](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-kanakia-spaces-d2379)\n\n## Kanakia Spaces Properties in Mumbai\n\nReady to Move\n\n![Kanakia Ananta](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/39096/Kanakia_Ananta_elevation_1.jpg)\n\n##### [Kanakia Ananta](https://www.addressofchoice.com/kanakia-ananta-mira-bhayandar-mumbai-p39096)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg) Mira Bhayandar, Mumbai\n\nPrice\n\n#### ₹ 1.33 Cr\n\n* ![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg \"Sports Facility\")\n* ![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg \"Kids Play Area\")\n* ![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg \"Swimming Pool\")\n* ![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg \"Lifts\")\n* ![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg \"Car Parking\")\n* ![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886749_water_storage.svg \"Water Storage\")\n\nReady to Move\n\n![Kanakia Space Celebration](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/39419/Kanakia_Space_Celebration_elevation_1.jpg)\n\n##### [Kanakia Space Celebration](https://www.addressofchoice.com/kanakia-space-celebration-virar-mumbai-p39419)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg) Virar, Mumbai\n\nPrice\n\n#### ₹ 56.82 Lakhs\n\n* ![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg \"Kids Play Area\")\n* ![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg \"Swimming Pool\")\n* ![](